{"id": "EUVD-2026-93122", "enisaUuid": "2c6a2746-701b-3573-bc23-2d0ffd15041c", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nwifi: libertas_tf: fix UAF in lbtf_free_adapter()\n\nlbtf_free_adapter() calls lbtf_free_cmd_buffer() to free the command\nbuffers before calling timer_delete_sync() to wait for the command\ntimer callback.  If the timer callback (command_timer_fn) is already\nrunning when lbtf_free_cmd_buffer() frees the command array, the\ncallback dereferences priv->cur_cmd->cmdbuf which points to freed\nmemory.\n\nSwap the order so that timer_delete_sync() runs first, ensuring any\nin-flight callback has completed before the command buffers are freed.", "datePublished": "2026-10-06T08:44:34", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T09:15:25", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3fb3663260ec396f86b733aab9f81fac6669d2fa", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f6c3fa0d17ca0c9e6033bb45f52e33b27a9a40e6", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b4745d6063758c681d33affca9733bbd356b6ea1", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/41b1a4d545ec348b7d5324b6d4f4c6a3e0326d46", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2b99bfc5a127ce8cd6a887d82815fc2e712f365b", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e82536aad653e27c8ca7a8e0f6f816bc3f853ec3", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/04c837d413dc11a91e0275b08b9e35a6c111175e", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/bbb9a0ab96d44a64529aafc7a16de460a1712f6a"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-98194", "GHSA-h7cr-x88p-mw28"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.18, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "07f1efb5-39e6-3fb5-8073-adbbe1688bf5", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "06b16ae5319251c26377afcb401e46056d5673f4 <bbb9a0ab96d44a64529aafc7a16de460a1712f6a"}, {"id": "0d4bd0bc-bcf0-3a29-ab6b-72ce97768109", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 5.15.222"}, {"id": "15f04282-6d9d-351d-b9d6-830fde27b7b1", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"